 drivers/usb/cdns3/Makefile     |   1 +
 drivers/usb/cdns3/cdnsp-sky1.c | 696 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/usb/cdns3/cdnsp-sky1.h | 127 ++++++
 4 files changed, 837 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/usb/cdns3/cdnsp-sky1.c
