gfar_hwtstamp_set() or gfar_reset_task(), or the ethtool ring/coalesce/
features paths) the field is a dangling pointer, and the next poll picks it
up:

drivers/net/ethernet/freescale/gianfar.c:gfar_clean_rx_ring() {
